{"ts":"2026-05-27T00:53:33.000Z","hook":"PostToolUse","payload":{"session_id":"4381b0d7-d67e-4187-bb2d-86a101d3b955","transcript_path":"/Users/ark/.claude/projects/-private-tmp/4381b0d7-d67e-4187-bb2d-86a101d3b955.jsonl","cwd":"/private/tmp","permission_mode":"default","effort":{"level":"xhigh"},"hook_event_name":"PostToolUse","tool_name":"WebSearch","tool_input":{"query":"Braintrust observability platform features 2026"},"tool_response":{"query":"Braintrust observability platform features 2026","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01C4uG3PxycbVa4R37X2hrn4","content":[{"title":"Braintrust - The AI observability platform for building quality AI products","url":"https://www.braintrust.dev/"},{"title":"AI observability tools: A buyer's guide to monitoring AI agents in production (2026) - Articles - Braintrust","url":"https://www.braintrust.dev/articles/best-ai-observability-tools-2026"},{"title":"Agent observability: The complete guide for 2026 - Articles - Braintrust","url":"https://www.braintrust.dev/articles/agent-observability-complete-guide-2026"},{"title":"Braintrust lands $80M funding round to become the observability layer for AI - SiliconANGLE","url":"https://siliconangle.com/2026/02/17/braintrust-lands-80m-series-b-funding-round-become-observability-layer-ai/"},{"title":"What Is Braintrust? Is It the Best for AI Observability?","url":"https://www.voiceflow.com/blog/what-is-braintrust"},{"title":"Braintrust: AI Observability & Evaluation Platform - Dynamic Business","url":"https://dynamicbusiness.com/ai-tools/braintrust-ai-observability-evaluation-platform.html"},{"title":"Best LLM monitoring tools in 2026 (tested & reviewed) - Articles - Braintrust","url":"https://www.braintrust.dev/articles/best-llm-monitoring-tools-2026"},{"title":"Braintrust Review 2026 - Guide to Key Product Features | XYZEO","url":"https://xyzeo.com/product/braintrust"},{"title":"How Braintrust is Becoming the Observability Layer for Production AI","url":"https://www.menlotimes.com/post/how-braintrust-is-becoming-the-observability-layer-for-production-ai"},{"title":"Top 5 Braintrust Alternatives and Competitors, Compared (2026) - Confident AI","url":"https://www.confident-ai.com/knowledge-base/compare/top-braintrust-alternatives-and-competitors-compared"}]},"Based on the search results, here's an overview of Braintrust's observability platform features in 2026:\n\n## Core Features\n\nBraintrust provides comprehensive AI observability features, including exhaustive tracing, automated evaluation, real-time monitoring, cost analytics, flexible integration options, and more.\n\n### Tracing & Monitoring\nBraintrust allows you to inspect every trace, drill into tool calls, and track latency, cost, and quality in real-time. Every step of your AI agent's reasoning gets captured — prompts, tool calls, retrieved context, latency, cost.\n\n### Evaluation & Quality\nBraintrust is the only platform that integrates evaluation directly into the observability workflow, scoring how well your agent performs using customizable metrics. You can run experiments against real datasets, compare prompts side-by-side, and catch regressions automatically in CI, with the ability to score using LLMs, code, or humans.\n\n### Loop Agent (AI Assistant)\nThe platform includes an AI agent named Loop that autonomously analyzes production logs, identifies failure patterns, and suggests optimizations for prompts, scorers, or new test cases.\n\n### Infrastructure & Performance\nBraintrust's purpose-built database, called Brainstore, is 80% faster at querying complex AI traces. Brainstore is designed specifically for AI observability so you can query millions of traces quickly.\n\n### Enterprise & Security\nBraintrust is SOC 2 Type II certified, GDPR compliant, with SSO, RBAC, HIPAA compliance, and hybrid deployment options out of the box.\n\n### Data Management\nBraintrust offers features such as unlimited users, projects, datasets, playgrounds, and experiments, facilitating extensive collaboration and experimentation."],"durationSeconds":8.787255208000003,"searchCount":1},"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RV5Tt1yyPakCbCZBjU9uux","duration_ms":8788}}
